  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nWhen XSS Auditor detects XSS in form \"action\" attribute, it changes it to about:blank. Attacker can add bogus parameters to make sensitive information <<submitted>> to about:blank. After that, XSS Auditor under some conditions will allow to brute request body char-by-cha"
